! The Elyncia Books

''The library's landing.'' Each chapter survives as a ''spine'' — a curated walk through the
meme graph, transcluding its chunks in reading order with the spine's own mortar between. The
chunks live at their topical addresses; the books remain readable wholes. Migration runs in
stages: spines first (standing) · verbatim moves into each home meme's `#source` staging ·
uplift to live wikitext last.

<<~/ahu>>

